# MPEG Player playing 実時間制御TAD (design 11.12, 15.5.1), for tools/ui_run.py: a
# sample whose applist names basic-player (MPEG Player's alias) opened, its scene
# played by the desktop in the player's window, a press, moves and Space passed on to it,
# full screen and back, closed; the sample 10.5's playlist stepped with Ctrl+N;
# and the programs 実行 offers for a link by the type of its object's record.
# MPEG Player opens with its work area near (104, 108): the video area, 640 by
# 360, over the control strip.
logmark
open 01a0d8c5-6a04-7a04-8a04-5e1a7d000004
expectsincein 60 player: hosted
waitwin MPEG Player 60
wait 800
shot player_waiting
# a press on the scene: the program's, and the window has the keys after it
logmark
click 420 280
expectsince op press
# the pointer's moves over the scene are the program's too (mouseenter, mouseleave)
move 380 240
move 440 300
expectsince op move
logmark
key 2C
expectsince op toggle
wait 800
shot player_playing
logmark
key 2C
expectsince op toggle
wait 300
shot player_paused
logmark
key 0F 01
expectsince mpegplay: fullscreen on
expectsince op area
wait 500
shot player_fullscreen
logmark
key 0F 01
expectsince mpegplay: fullscreen off
wait 300
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince closed by its process
logmark
open 01a0d8c5-6a05-7a05-8a05-5e1a7d000005
expectsincein 60 player: hosted
waitwin MPEG Player 60
click 420 280
key 2C
wait 2500
shot player_track
logmark
key 11 01
expectsince op track
wait 1500
shot player_next_track
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince closed by its process
# 実行 on the link to 仮身サンプル in the first window: スライド and MPEG Player take any xmlTAD
click 60 131
wait 300
click 60 131 1
wait 600
move 68 372
wait 800
shot exec_menu
key 29
wait 200
key 29
wait 300
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
